Package: sonic-thermalctld-rs
Source: sonic
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: SONiC Team <sonic-dev@lists.sonicfoundation.dev>
Installed-Size: 1485
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39), libgcc-s1 (>= 4.2), libswsscommon (>= 1.0.0)
Section: net
Priority: optional
Description: SONiC thermal control daemon in Rust (native Mellanox sysfs)
 Rust port of thermalctld for Mellanox/NVIDIA platforms. Reads thermal and
 fan state directly from hw-management sysfs instead of importing a Python
 platform plugin or using a gRPC server, so the daemon carries no Python
 interpreter and no extra process. Writes the same TEMPERATURE_INFO,
 FAN_INFO, FAN_DRAWER_INFO and PHYSICAL_ENTITY_INFO entries to STATE_DB
 as the Python implementation.
